# Force LF line endings for shell scripts regardless of the checking-out
# platform's git config. Without this, a Windows client with the common
# core.autocrlf=true default silently converts these to CRLF on checkout,
# which corrupts the #!/bin/sh shebang once the file is copied into a Linux
# container and breaks the entrypoint with a cryptic
# "exec /docker-entrypoint.sh: no such file or directory" — hit for real on
# the Windows homelab host the first time backend/frontend were built from
# source there (see docs/homelab/deployment.md).
*.sh text eol=lf
